Original module root: ErgodicTheory.Entropy; copied subset listed by local files.

Local changes: imports moved to VV.Entropy and proofs ported to the project's
pinned Lean 4.20.1 / mathlib 5c0c94b3f563ed756b48b9439788c53b0d56a897.
The upstream toolchain was Lean 4.30.0-rc2 with mathlib
34f7a6cd150fd7a166958d989d5abab56e9e3d15. No upstream compiled binaries are used.
Initial copied upstream modules (eleven): Partition, Join, Subadditive,
Subadditive2, Fekete, KSEntropy, KSEntropyBounds, KSEntropySystem, FactorMap,
FactorEntropy, KSEntropyConjugacy.
The concrete compatibility changes are the local import root and replacement
of Fin.val_castAdd / Fin.val_natAdd by Fin.coe_castAdd / Fin.coe_natAdd.
WeakContinuity.lean is newly written for this project, not copied upstream.
SmallPartition.lean is newly written for this project, not copied upstream.
CompactProbability.lean is adapted from the compact-space portion of mathlib4
Mathlib/MeasureTheory/Measure/Prokhorov.lean at commit
34f7a6cd150fd7a166958d989d5abab56e9e3d15.
